#
# bbawk: awk alone, the one busybox of the card whose exec is order 6, as the initramfs' busybox
# (with expr and dc it was larger still: bbcalc has those). Its math functions (sqrt, sin, exp,
# log, atan2, ...: libm) and the GNU extensions are awk's defaults, which bbconfig.sh turns off
# unless named here.
CONFIG_AWK=y
CONFIG_FEATURE_AWK_LIBM=y
CONFIG_FEATURE_AWK_GNU_EXTENSIONS=y
